WEBVTT

1
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:59.740
A face. a fleet. a war. a man. a thought. a dream. a dream. a dream. a dream. a dream.

2
00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:00.840
A trick.

3
00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:06.020
A trick to break the walls of Troy.

4
00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:11.260
And burn it. screaming to the ground.

5
00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:59.720
I don't know what's going on. but I don't know what to do.

6
00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:04.140
What does it mean?

7
00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:16.400
A gift...

8
00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:18.380
for Athena.

9
00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:22.720
Common gods...

10
00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:24.840
