58
00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:13.020
So he doesn't follow Zeus' law. then?

59
00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:15.640
Zeus' law tells us to treat strangers

60
00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:18.360
as we'd be treated because they might be gods in disguise.

61
00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:20.660
I think we've established. Antinous.

62
00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:21.760
