158
00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:42.720
Antinous.

159
00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:43.240
Draw.

160
00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:46.180
Yes.

161
00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:47.120
By lots?

162
00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:52.140
Antinous told me he volunteered.

163
00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:53.700
We've got to do something.

164
00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:04.700
