What he wanted. Antinous. was to look after me.

171
00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:23.660
No. no. no.

172
00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:26.320
But Odysseus was sensitive to a father's shame.

173
00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:27.800
He fell for these fathers.

174
00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:30.320
You and your mother meant more to him

175
00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:31.820
than promises of glory.

176
00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:34.640
So he knew it would be years.

177
00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:36.840
Did he tell my mother?

178
00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:38.860
That's a question for her.

179
00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:42.080
You may ask. is he ever coming back?

180
00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:45.060
Hargis thinks so.

181
00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:47.080
Never known a dog reached 20.

182
00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:50.480
But he's long outlived his master.

183
00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:09.140
I didn't mean to stop you.

184
00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:12.800
I'm in no hurry.

185
00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:15.760
