245
00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:27.460
but fall on all that I've got.

246
00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:45.080
I promise me. if I don't return by the time Telemachus comes of age. promise me. you'll

247
00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:50.020
