What if I can't?

256
00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:24.360
Then your memory won't be making my decisions.

257
00:16:29.260 --> 00:16:33.020
I think my men wear it always.

258
00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:34.680
Athena will bring you home.

259
00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:36.980
I'm not sure it suits me.

260
