When travelers claim to have seen you.

261
00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:43.640
I'll ask where you are wearing.

262
00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:45.340
and I'll know if they're alive.

263
00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:51.020
If the people from the sea are real.

264
