272
00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:47.000
Yeah.

273
00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:53.280
Yeah.

274
00:17:53.280 --> 00:17:53.640
Yeah.

275
00:17:54.820 --> 00:17:55.000
Yeah.

276
00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:09.100
No one else ever did it.

277
00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:13.580
Mom. they're bleeding us dry. so you'll be forced to choose one of them before I can

278
00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:14.760
