898
01:18:01.900 --> 01:18:03.260
And you think that's against their nature?

899
01:18:03.500 --> 01:18:05.640
You think they only did that because you ordered them to?

900
01:18:06.140 --> 01:18:09.420
A true commander thinks his men's savagery is actually discipline.

901
01:18:10.580 --> 01:18:12.200
You don't seem that deluded.

902
01:18:12.760 --> 01:18:14.440
But you sent them to me here.

903
01:18:14.640 --> 01:18:15.640
On my own.

904
