We need to know the way to the trade routes.

937
01:20:13.180 --> 01:20:14.240
You're too lost.

938
01:20:14.980 --> 01:20:15.620
What do you mean?

939
01:20:17.240 --> 01:20:20.340
Only blind Teresias can tell you how to go home.

940
01:20:20.580 --> 01:20:20.900
Teresias?

941
01:20:21.640 --> 01:20:22.380
In Hades.

942
01:20:23.340 --> 01:20:26.240
Nobody sails into hell and comes back.

943
01:20:26.660 --> 01:20:27.440
You will.

944
01:20:28.860 --> 01:20:30.680
Head north into the twilight.

945
01:20:36.840 --> 01:20:41.300
And head inland until a river of fire meets a river of ice.

946
01:21:31.760 --> 01:21:38.780
There you must dig a trench and fill it with the blood of sacrifice.

947
01:21:58.100 --> 01:22:03.760
And learn how you go home.

948
01:22:05.420 --> 01:22:06.200
You.

949
