I begged to take Antinous' place.

967
01:24:01.460 --> 01:24:02.280
He'd been called.

968
01:24:03.140 --> 01:24:04.880
He offered money for your family

969
01:24:04.880 --> 01:24:06.260
If you take his place.

970
01:24:07.320 --> 01:24:09.380
If the Trojans don't let me live.

971
01:24:11.060 --> 01:24:12.780
if I never make it home.

972
01:24:13.620 --> 01:24:15.160
take this back to my father.

973
01:24:16.840 --> 01:24:18.480
tell him everything I did.

974
01:24:21.880 --> 01:24:22.480
Odysseus.

975
01:24:24.420 --> 01:24:26.420
feel free to add some stuff.

976
01:24:29.640 --> 01:24:31.960
You didn't trust me with the truth?

977
01:24:33.640 --> 01:24:35.660
You knew I'd die for you.

978
01:24:35.920 --> 01:24:38.440
Dying meant tell the truth. I needed you to believe.

979
01:24:39.080 --> 01:24:41.460
I died for your lie on that beach.

980
01:24:42.400 --> 01:24:44.960
I know. I was there with you.

981
01:24:45.320 --> 01:24:48.060
I heard you repeat the lie with your dying breath.

982
01:24:48.460 --> 01:24:49.500
winning us the war.

983
01:24:50.040 --> 01:24:52.600
I was right there. inches from you. smelling your blood.

984
01:24:52.760 --> 01:24:54.700
What comfort could that give me?

985
01:24:56.100 --> 01:25:00.040
Not knowing you were beside that horse until the dead told me.

986
01:25:01.100 --> 01:25:01.740
Which dead?

987
01:25:01.740 --> 01:25:05.780
A lot of veterans of your campaigns walk these shores.

988
01:25:08.260 --> 01:25:12.900
The dead meet to lament the living and greet the newly dead.

989
01:25:13.780 --> 01:25:16.400
My father was the first shade to find me.

990
01:25:16.720 --> 01:25:17.700
To comfort you.

991
01:25:18.300 --> 01:25:19.380
Shades don't comfort.

992
01:25:20.300 --> 01:25:23.580
They want word of the living who wronged them.

993
01:25:24.480 --> 01:25:28.060
My father had died in poverty. alone.

994
01:25:28.060 --> 01:25:31.660
Begging for scraps from people like Antinous.

995
01:25:32.220 --> 01:25:33.540
Antinous cheated you?

996
01:25:34.520 --> 01:25:36.360
As he's no doubt cheating you.

997
01:25:36.880 --> 01:25:37.280
How?

998
01:25:37.600 --> 01:25:40.180
Who's in Ithaca looking after your wife and son?

999
01:25:40.540 --> 01:25:42.000
My wife is of no concern.

1000
01:25:43.840 --> 01:25:46.100
Talk to Agamemnon about homecomings.

1001
01:25:47.340 --> 01:25:48.320
Agamemnon's here?

1002
01:25:51.440 --> 01:25:55.020
You buried me at Troy with respect. thank you.

1003
01:25:55.020 --> 01:25:57.980
But spare a thought for those who didn't.

1004
01:25:58.320 --> 01:25:59.740
It's not always possible.

1005
01:26:00.920 --> 01:26:01.960
When you get home.

1006
01:26:03.200 --> 01:26:05.760
take a ship. head into the unknown west

1007
01:26:05.760 --> 01:26:07.020
till you find land.

1008
01:26:07.400 --> 01:26:11.040
and there give sacrifice and honor your men.

1009
01:26:13.300 --> 01:26:14.600
Do you still have the lot?

1010
01:26:18.180 --> 01:26:19.060
Of course.

1011
01:26:20.180 --> 01:26:23.180
If you make it home. give Antinous back his shame.

1012
01:26:23.700 --> 01:26:24.280
I will.

1013
01:26:24.280 --> 01:26:25.670
Come on.

1014
01:26:36.280 --> 01:26:36.460
My lord.

1015
01:26:48.810 --> 01:26:49.300
Odysseus.

1016
01:26:50.640 --> 01:26:51.440
How are you here?

1017
01:26:52.160 --> 01:26:54.420
We won the war. you're headed for home.

1018
01:26:55.360 --> 01:26:58.200
Odysseus. the most brilliant of all my generals.

1019
01:26:59.820 --> 01:27:01.440
He would never be snared as I was.

1020
01:27:01.540 --> 01:27:03.300
When you cast the drift. like us.

1021
01:27:04.160 --> 01:27:07.000
No. My misfortune was to make it home.

1022
01:27:08.400 --> 01:27:10.900
